/** \page release_notes Revision History

\section rev_3_7_1 Revision 3.7.1
  - Functional changes.
    - Replace switch "-o" that prevents rigs from being started with "-s <rig>" that
    allows specified rigs to be started automatically.
  - Cosmetic and non-functional changes.
    - Increase size of buttons in international virtual keyboard.
    - Add switch to vary font size in user interface between 8 and 12.
    - Add current sticky switches to help display.
    - Display station callsign in banner.
  - Performance changes.
    - None.
  - Bug fixes.
    - Pasting from international virtual keyboard no longer functioning.
    - Restore focus to target widget after pasting from international virtual keyboard.
    - Add description of characters in international virtual keyboard to tooltip.
    - Navigating to date when book is empty crashes application.
    - Checking "Enable Mirroring" in settings didn't enable the input to define the path.
    - Couldn't type into "NOTES" field in qso entry panel.
    - Lost the ability to change the path to the QSL Cards folder in settings.
    - If mirroring is enabled in writeback mode the target file may be overwritten
      with an old mirror file when the application is closed.
    - Display "CLOSING" in banner when closed from application as well as banner.
    - Search text input in toolbar didn't accept input.
    - "CQ SA ...." message from WSJT-X being misinterpreted as a callsign.
    - Existing "DXCC" value in QSO record ignored when parsing record.
    - Log Table font and size not saved correctly.

\section rev_3_7 Revision 3.7
  - Functional changes.
    - None.
  - Cosmetic and non-functional changes.
    - Reworking of development flow to allow reuse with other applications.
  - Performance changes.
    - None.
  - Bug fixes.
    - None.

\subpage rev_3_6 


*/